# No user.conf change is needed any more.
# The companion mod keeps rtx.enableTransmissionApproximationInIndirectRays at its shipped True and writes
# rtx.viewDistance.noiseScale and rtx.viewDistance.distanceFadeMin itself at runtime.
# Do NOT put those two keys (or an old rtx.enableTransmissionApproximationInIndirectRays = False line from an earlier
# version of this repository) into <profile>/user.conf: a value there outranks the mod's live writes.
